   "title": "No drug-related violations found in special crackdown on eve of Halloween",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/20261031/no-drug-related-violations-found-in-special-crackdown-on-eve-of-halloween",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "published": "Sat, 31 Oct 2026 02:42:04 GMT",
   "_dt": 1793414524.0,
   "ageDays": 0.02,
   "summary": "Police said Saturday they have found no drug-related violations during a joint crackdown the previous night on nightlife districts in Seoul on the eve of Halloween. Police carried out inspections at eight clubs in nightlife districts in Gangnam, Seocho and Yongsan on Friday night as part of a special drug crackdown that has been under way since August in cooperation with fire and municipality authorities.",
   "summary_zh": "警方周六表示，在万圣节前夕对首尔夜生活区开展的联合整治行动中，他们未发现与毒品有关的违法行为。周五夜间，警方在Gangnam、Seocho和Yongsan夜生活区的8家夜总会进行了检查。这是警方自8月以来与消防和地方政府 authorities合作开展的专项禁毒整治行动的一部分。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Police said Saturday they have found no drug-related violations during a joint crackdown the previous night on nightlife districts in Seoul on the eve of Halloween. Police carried out inspections at eight clubs in nightlife districts in Gangnam, Seocho and Yongsan on Friday night as part of a special drug crackdown that has been under way since August in cooperation with fire and municipality authorities. \"Ahead of Halloween, we conducted crackdowns focusing on clubs, entertainment venues, and areas with high concentrations of foreigners, where large crowds are expected,\" a police official said. \"We will continue to strengthen inspections and crackdown activities in vulnerable areas.\" Police urged the public to actively report drug-related crimes, saying they will guarantee the anonymity of informants and rewards will be provided",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
   "country": [
    "kr"
   ],
   "topic": [
    "pol"
   ],
   "tier": 4,
   "actor": "第三方",
   "alsoUS": false,
   "cnHit": false,
