   "title": "PDP Rainbow Coalition in Bayelsa Adopts Tinubu as Presidential Candidate",
   "url": "https://www.thisdaylive.com/2026/10/31/pdp-rainbow-coalition-in-bayelsa-adopts-tinubu-as-presidential-candidate/",
   "domain": "thisdaylive.com",
