   "title": "BOYNEXTDOOR to launch 1st N. American tour",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/entertainment/k-pop/20261030/boynextdoor-to-launch-1st-n-american-tour",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "published": "Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:52:03 GMT",
   "_dt": 1793371923.0,
   "ageDays": 0.52,
   "summary": "K-pop group BOYNEXTDOOR will kick off its first-ever North American tour Friday (U.S. time) with a show in Dallas, the group's agency, Koz Entertainment, said. We hope audiences look forward to our explosive energy and chemistry with them.\" The North American dates are part of BOYNEXTDOOR's first-ever world tour, titled \"Knock on Vol.",
   "summary_zh": "K-pop组合BOYNEXTDOOR的首度北美巡回演唱会将于星期五（美国时间）从达拉斯拉开帷幕，该组合的经纪公司Koz Entertainment表示。希望观众期待我们充满爆发力的舞台表现以及与观众之间的化学反应。”北美巡演日期是BOYNEXTDOOR首次世界巡演“敲响音量”的一部分。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "K-pop group BOYNEXTDOOR will kick off its first-ever North American tour Friday (U.S. time) with a show in Dallas, the group's agency, Koz Entertainment, said. Following the Dallas concert, the sextet is scheduled to perform in Florida, Chicago, New York, Toronto, Vancouver, Seattle, San Francisco, Los Angeles and Mexico City through Nov. 24. \"Every visit to the United States has given us meaningful memories and positive inspiration, so we are excited for this trip too,\" the group said in a release. \"We will perform with passion and return with happy memories. We hope audiences look forward to our explosive energy and chemistry with them.\" The North American dates are part of BOYNEXTDOOR's first-ever world tour, titled \"Knock on Vol. 2,\" which began in Seoul in July and continued across Japan. Following the North American leg, the group is set to perform in six other Asian regions into January 2027",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
