   "_dt": 1793308254.0,
   "ageDays": 1.25,
   "summary": "The government has launched the Cabinet-approved Ghana Pharmaceutical Manufacturing Policy, seeking to double domestic medicine production, create skilled jobs and position the country as a leading pharmaceutical manufacturing hub in West Africa.",
   "summary_zh": "政府已启动经内阁批准的《加纳制药制造政策》，旨在将国内药品产量翻倍、创造技术熟练岗位，并将加纳打造为西非领先的制药制造中心。",
