   "title": "India and Mexico sign Terms of Reference for preferential trade agreement negotiations to begin",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/business/Economy/india-and-mexico-sign-terms-of-reference-for-preferential-trade-agreement-negotiations-to-begin/article71635915.ece",
