   "snippet": "🇳🇬🤝🇨🇳 Nigeria–China Strategic Partnership!\nNigeria’s Ambassador to China, Lt. Gen. Abdulrahman Bello Dambazau, has engaged the Chairman of the World High-Tech Industrialization Cooperation Organisation, Mr Huang Chunxiao, to explore opportunities in technology transfer, industrial development and investment. \n\nThe engagement aims to attract Chinese technological expertise, strengthen local industries, build Nigerian capacity and create investment opportunities for sustainable economic growth.\n\nDiplomacy that goes beyond relationships to creating practical opportunities for Nigeria and Nigerians. 🇳🇬🇨🇳 ©\n\nMay PBAT succeed ❤️ 🇳🇬 🤲 \n\n@woye1\n\n#Arewa4Asiwaju",
   "body": "🇳🇬🤝🇨🇳 Nigeria–China Strategic Partnership!\nNigeria’s Ambassador to China, Lt. Gen. Abdulrahman Bello Dambazau, has engaged the Chairman of the World High-Tech Industrialization Cooperation Organisation, Mr Huang Chunxiao, to explore opportunities in technology transfer, industrial development and investment. \n\nThe engagement aims to attract Chinese technological expertise, strengthen local industries, build Nigerian capacity and create investment opportunities for sustainable economic growth.\n\nDiplomacy that goes beyond relationships to creating practical opportunities for Nigeria and Nigerians. 🇳🇬🇨🇳 ©\n\nMay PBAT succeed ❤️ 🇳🇬 🤲 \n\n@woye1\n\n#Arewa4Asiwaju",
