   "title": "China has renewable energy and oil imports from it's neighbors Russia and its Central Asian countries like Kazakhstan at long term contract",
   "url": "https://x.com/Ignis_Rex/status/2115975797072859643",
   "snippet": "China has renewable energy and oil imports from it's neighbors Russia and its Central Asian countries like Kazakhstan at long term contract price. It only import oil from the Persian Gulf when it is cheap.\n\nIf you look at electricity consumption as a proxy for economic size, China is bigger than US, EU and India combined.\n\nSo yes it is very \"desperate\" according to some people who has never been to China.",
